160 0 obj
<</E(Eco-friendly innovations are new ideas, products, and technologies that help protect the environment and reduce pollution. The RRR concept stands for Reduce, Reuse, and Recycle. It encourages people to minimize waste, reuse useful items, and recycle materials to conserve natural resources. Our project, EcoSwap, aims to promote sustainable living by helping people exchange unwanted items, donate reusable products, and learn proper waste management.)/K[ 0]/P 124 0 R /Pg 11 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<</E(Introduction)/K[ 1]/P 124 0 R /Pg 11 0 R /S/H1/T(Introduction)/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<</E(Today, increasing population, plastic pollution, and improper waste disposal are major environmental challenges. Many useful items, such as clothes, books, bottles, and electronic products, are thrown away instead of being reused or donated. This creates unnecessary waste and consumes natural resources. Eco-friendly innovations offer practical solutions to these problems. The EcoSwap app applies the RRR principle by connecting people who have unwanted items with people who need them.)/K[ 2]/P 124 0 R /Pg 11 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
